5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a system based on actual data, not guesses. I want to see the real time commitment involved.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! It feels like some of us are doing way more than others lately. Let's be fair!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think it's important to understand our different standards first. We should avoid future friction by being clear.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know where the money goes! Who is paying for the soap and bags? It's a mystery!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just want it to be... consistent. I don't like the surprises.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, that's a valid point. Subjective standards often lead to the inefficiency I'm worried about.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, don't be shy! We can make it super simple so there are no surprises for you.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, simplicity is good, but clarity is better. I'm worried about the tension if we just ""wing it.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,Let's look at the receipts! I bet we can find a pattern if we look at the papers!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I guess I'll look into the kitchen use. And maybe what people count as ""done.""","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm going to check the calendar and the kitchen use too. I want to see who's actually home!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the house chat records and the previous tenants' notes. I want to see how we've failed before.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the management office rates! Maybe they have a secret cleaning service for us!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
