35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The actual time required is higher than I expected. A full pass is over an hour and a half.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,Wow! I found out that some of us are barely even here! It's not fair to split everything equally.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It seems our history is a cycle of reminders and resentment. We must be careful not to repeat it.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Guess what! We're spending way too much on spray because we buy it twice! And professional cleaners are expensive!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I found out that we all have different ideas of what ""clean"" means. That's why it's so unpredictable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, presence doesn't always equal usage. @Daisuke, that's exactly why we need a standardized checklist.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, but if you're not here, you aren't making the mess! We should adjust based on usage.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"If we focus too much on ""fairness"" in terms of minutes, we might end up counting every second. That's dangerous.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,But we're wasting money! We need a money-box or a list of who paid for what!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,A checklist... that sounds... safe. I'd like that.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"A professional firm is an option, but the terms are restrictive. We'd still have to tidy up first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I still think we should look at the kitchen use. Some of us are just coffee-drinkers!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, let's not turn this into a trial. I'd rather we find a way to coexist peacefully.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I think we should just pay one person to do it! But who? And how much?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don't want to... argue about who does more. I just want to know it's clean.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"We have three paths: a strict rotation with a checklist, a usage-based split, or hiring a firm.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,Usage-based is the only way to be truly fair!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I prefer the checklist rotation. It's predictable and removes the need for constant negotiation.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"As long as we figure out the money for the sponges and bags, I'm happy!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Victoria. The checklist sounds... less scary.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
