60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is the most logical for distribution, but Option C removes the time burden entirely.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,I can't vote for B! It's not fair to the people who are never home. I'm leaning toward C!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option C is the safest for our relationships. It removes the source of conflict entirely.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C sounds like a big adventure! But wait, who pays the bill? We need a rule for that!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think Option C would be the best. I wouldn't have to... worry about who did what.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, @Victoria, @Mio, it seems you all prefer C. However, the cost is a factor.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Victoria"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,I'm okay with paying if it means we stop fighting about the kitchen!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,The cost of a cleaner is far lower than the cost of a broken friendship.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll vote for C, but only if we make a ""Money Rule"" so nobody is out of pocket!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm okay with paying. It's worth it for the... peace of mind.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If we go with C, we must be strict about the ""tidying"" requirement mentioned in the terms.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,I can handle tidying! I'm great at that!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"As long as we agree on the tidying standard, I think this is the most sustainable path.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! No more fighting over the sponges!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I feel better about this.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will vote for C as well. It is the only way to truly reclaim the time I'm losing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
